Around 3 pm, a Maersk executive walked into the room where Jensen and a doz=
en or so of his colleagues were anxiously awaiting news and told them to go=
 home. Maersk=E2=80=99s network was so deeply corrupted that even IT staffe=
rs were helpless. A few of the company=E2=80=99s more old-school managers t=
old their teams to remain at the office. But many employees=E2=80=94rendere=
d entirely idle without computers, servers, routers, or desk phones=E2=80=
=94simply left.</p><div class=3D"AdWrapper-dQtivb fZrssQ ad ad--sponsor-pro=
