div><p class=3D"paywall">In 2017, the malware NotPetya spread from the serv=
ers of an unassuming Ukrainian software firm to some of the largest busines=
ses worldwide, paralyzing their operations. Here=E2=80=99s a list of the ap=
proximate damages reported by some of the worm=E2=80=99s biggest victims.</=
p><div role=3D"heading" aria-level=3D"3" class=3D"paywall heading-h3">$870,=
