=99s office, Henrik Jensen was at home in his Copenhagen apartment, enjoyin=
g a brunch of poached eggs, toast, and marmalade. Since he=E2=80=99d walked=
 out of the office the Tuesday before, he hadn=E2=80=99t heard a word from =
any of his superiors. Then his phone rang.</p><p class=3D"paywall">When he =
answered, he found himself on a conference call with three Maersk staffers.=
 He was needed, they said, at Maersk=E2=80=99s office in Maidenhead, Englan=
d, a town west of London where the conglomerate=E2=80=99s IT overlords, Mae=
rsk Group Infrastructure Services, were based. They told him to drop everyt=
hing and go there. Immediately.</p></div></div></div><div class=3D"GridItem=
